WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.040
Picture stories need an order of events and connections between each picture.

00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:10.267
A child returned extra change to a trader. Which value did the child show? Answer:

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:10.627
Honesty

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:15.887
Draw three pictures showing a helpful action and write one sentence per picture.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.708
Discuss why: Returning what is not yours is honest.
